	"img": "icons/creatures/magical/fae-fairy-winged-glowing-green.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 6th level, you gain resistance to either fire or cold damage, as determined by the damage of your Sanguine Transference.</p><p>Additionally, when you are hit with a melee weapon attack, you may use your reaction to cause one illusory copy of you appear in your space, as in the spell @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-spells.Item.05w9nzp0kvu94k3h]{Mirror Image}. This duplicate has the same statistics as in the spell, and a creature attempting to attack you must roll a [[/r 1d20]], hitting the copy on a roll of 11 or higher. This illusory copy persists for a number of rounds equal to your Constitution modifier, until it is destroyed, or until you dismiss it as a bonus action. Once you have used this ability, you may not do so again until you complete a short or a long rest.</p>",
